    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are occupying the Helm crew station of an elemental airship and controlling its elemental ring.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You push the bound elemental spirit past its containment safety governors to squeeze out maximum propulsion. The airship gains a +15-foot status bonus to its Fly Speed for the current round. You must immediately roll a DC 5 flat check. On a failure, the containment coils overheat and suffer blowback: the airship becomes slowed 1 for 1 round as the elemental ring flickers and recalibrates.</p>"
    },
